]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[97]},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一﹑？？？\n\n失败条件\n一﹑姜维死亡。\n二、张翼死亡。"]},{"op":26,"name":"battle_goal_text","args":["�@�N�H�H�H"]},{"op":90,"name":"ui_5a","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_result","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":6802,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":6804,"title":"ね瓁北��","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["ね瓁北��"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[1,0]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,0,2,0,7]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,46,32]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":6889,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":65,"name":"test_units_in_area","args":[2,0,2,0,5,13,19,27]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[12]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,143,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,144,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,56,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,32,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,118,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,716,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,306,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,307,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,308,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,309,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,310,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,311,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,312,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,313,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,322,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,323,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,324,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,325,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,326,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,327,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,328,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,329,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,282,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,283,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,284,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,285,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,286,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,287,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,288,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,289,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&李辅\n西门根本进不去，那个怪物一个人就挡住\n我们大军。\n&蒋舒\n那个怪物叫袁綝，在蜀地本来就是武艺\n超群的名将，只是没想到会这么厉害。\n&句安\n所以我们不能和他纠缠下去，只派王买\n将军留在那里牵制他，大家转往东门进\n去。\n&皇甫闿\n我祖上平定黄巾之乱，今天就让我来平定\n钟会之乱！\n&夏侯咸\n看来今天姓夏侯的要翻身了，一定要把\n钟会给大卸八块！\n&蒋舒\n想不到热闹繁荣的成都会变成这样的战场\n，而且居然是我亲自下的手。\n&句安\n还不是姜维搞成这样的？要是他乖乖投降\n，不要煽动钟会的话，不就什么事情都没\n有了？\n&蒋舒\n话是这样没错…等一下，那不是张翼吗？\n&句安\n那死老头也想跟着姜维一起死呀，那就\n成全他吧，可别因为他是益州人就放过\n他。\n&蒋舒\n我知道，就交给我吧。\n&蒋舒\n至少我可以让他死得有尊严…\n&李辅\n这两个降将说话还这么大声，真是大言\n不惭。\n&王韬\n你自己不也是降将？\n&李辅\n少啰嗦！你以为我喜欢投降啊！看申仪和\n邓贤的下场，我能活到现在就算走运了。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n还真是源源不绝地来…\n&钟会\n杀光他们！朕命令你杀光他们！"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[0,107,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n钟会！你难道还不明白，你的皇帝梦已经\n破灭了？\n&钟会\n不可能，我今之张良，算无遗策…\n&姜维\n（不行了，这个人根本就是靠野心撑起\n来的，当野心破灭的同时，整个人也垮\n了。）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[12,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":2,"offset":8575,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[137,70,12],[13]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,147,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,581,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,346,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,347,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,348,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,349,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,350,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,351,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,352,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,353,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&胡烈\n钟会！你的死期到了！\n&羊琇\n你自己为是张良再世，却没想到我娘智慧\n可远胜于你。\n&钟会\n住口！住口！你们这些贱民敢对朕这样说\n话？\n&胡烈\n稚舒，宰了他，让这次的乱事画下句点。\n&羊琇\n这神圣的工作还是交给武玄你吧…\n&胡烈\n………（泰山羊家的人都这么胆小？）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[13,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":9050,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":65,"name":"test_units_in_area","args":[4,1,2,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[14]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,148,0,10,2,2]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[148,7,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&胡渊\n该死的姜维！因为你，让我在剑门关受辱\n，让父亲差点遇害，更让我安定胡家颜面\n无光，今天绝对要杀了你！"]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,148,0,0,0,0,0,6,0,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,148,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":78,"name":"unit_op_4e","args":[0,148,0,0,0,0,6,3,0,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n连个小将都有这样的气势，看来贼人真的\n气数未尽，今日之败，似乎也不完全是天\n命呀…"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[14,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":9591,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":65,"name":"test_units_in_area","args":[2,8,1,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[12],[]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,306,0,8,17,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,307,0,9,17,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,308,0,10,17,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,309,0,11,17,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,322,0,8,18,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,323,0,9,18,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,324,0,10,18,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,325,0,11,18,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":9924,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[15,32,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[70]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[15,32,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[32,15,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张翼\n你这不要脸的叛将，还有脸出现在我\n面前？\n&蒋舒\n我若是继续待在大汉，只怕一生都没有\n出头的机会，您也该知道益州人的地位\n有多卑微。\n&张翼\n那么现在变成降将又如何？那些人有给你\n尊重？\n&蒋舒\n…我已经回不去了。\n&张翼\n早知如此，何必当初。\n&蒋舒\n张将军，我真的很尊敬您，能够以一个\n益州人的身份，排除万难爬到高位。\n&蒋舒\n所以我希望，能够在最后让您有个尊严\n的死。\n&张翼\n想要我的项上人头是吗？那就来吧。\n&张翼\n（哈哈哈，就给这个可悲的家伙吧，\n反正我也没有多余的力气了。）"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["虫珼矪竚"]},"end":49},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[15,32,19]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"在死以前，也要带你这叛将一起\n下去。�C",9]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"………",8]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"张将军，得罪了。",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"哼！有本事就打倒我！\n说这么多废话都是枉然。",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,3]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"呼…呼…呼…这刀真是越来越沉\n重…果然是老了吗？",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"杀！",1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,0,0]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,2,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,12]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"唔…",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,8]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"张将军，您辛苦了。",1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_act