,"name":"dialog","args":["&句安\n为什么你要搞成这样？明明只要投降，\n你就可以得到享不尽的荣华富贵。\n&句安\n更让我搞不懂的是，你明明就不是蜀人，\n为什么要这么拚命？\n&姜维\n句安，难道我就一定要做对自己有利的\n事情？难道你不认为除了利益以外，还有\n更多重要的事情？\n&句安\n哼，真可笑。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[42,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":9,"offset":13365,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[15,2]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[70,71,137],[11]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[0,9,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n看来撑到现在已经是极限了…手抬不起来\n，身体也越来越沉重…\n&姜维\n大家…对不起…"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":89,"name":"op_59","args":[0,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[11,1]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[645,1]},{"op":73,"name":"ui_49","args":[]},{"op":13,"name":"next_scene","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":10,"offset":13601,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[144,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[240]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯咸\n这年头姓夏侯的真是有够没地位。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,144,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[240,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":11,"offset":13739,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[143,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[154]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&皇甫闿\n皇甫家还有明天吗？"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,143,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[154,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":12,"offset":13865,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[581,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[231]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&羊琇\n娘呀！救救我呀！"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,581,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[231,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":13,"offset":13987,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[148,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[78]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&胡渊\n没这么容易结束的，我要杀光你们这些\n蜀贼！"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,148,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[78,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":14,"offset":14134,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[118,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[55]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&王韬\n我是文官，打小力一点。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,118,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[55,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":15,"offset":14270,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[147,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[52]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&胡烈\n为了安定胡家的未来，我不能死在这里。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,147,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[52,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":16,"offset":14420,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[56,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[241]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&句安\n真衰，想来补刀还被扁。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,56,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[241,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":17,"offset":14548,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[15,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[80]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张翼\n哈哈哈哈哈…杀了那么多贼兵，还真是\n赚到了！"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,15,0,0,0,0,6,1]},{"op":73,"name":"ui_49","args":[]},{"op":14,"name":"ui_0e","args":[]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[80,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":18,"offset":14705,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[107,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[72,13]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&钟会\n朕不会死的，朕不会死在你们这群蝼蚁\n的手下！"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,107,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,107,0,10,1,2]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":19,"offset":14876,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[107,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[13],[71]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[107,9,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&钟会\n这张龙椅应该是朕的，天下应该被像朕\n这样优秀的人统治，上天为什么不长眼\n，让司马昭那种庸才取得天下？\n&钟会\n哈哈哈哈哈…一切都是幻觉…吓不倒朕\n的，朕明明就要召见群臣…朕是万世圣\n君…"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[0,107,65535,0,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n就算是幻影，你也满足？难道当皇帝真的\n这么有吸引力？\n&钟会\n难道你不想？权力的欲望任何人都有，\n你凭什么说我？\n&姜维\n我和你不同，有许多的理想和伙伴支撑\n我一路向前。\n&姜维\n不像你，除了欲望还是欲望。\n&钟会\n姜维，不要骗自己了，你分明只是为了\n自己的功名而战，你跟我没什么两样！\n&姜维\n你真是可悲，难道你以为所有的人\n都是为名利而战？不，我心中有理想\n，有坚持，我愿意抛弃一切为了大汉。\n&钟会\n呵哈哈哈…你问司马昭，他也会说这样\n的话；你问曹操，他也会说这样的话，\n事实上呢？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&姜维\n钟会…不知为什么…像你这样纯粹的恶者\n，反而让我不知道该如何憎恨起…"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&钟会\n怎么回事？娘，您为什么出现在我眼前？\n&钟会\n我是皇帝了，是皇帝了，没有人可以欺负\n您，您可以放心看孩儿！"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,107,0,0,0,0,6,1]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[71,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":20,"offset":15875,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[46,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[137]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&蒋斌\n爹…您看到了吗？儿子我虽然能力不如您\n，但至少也做到以身殉国了。"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,46,0,0,0,0,6,1]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[137,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":21,"offset":16048,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[32,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[153]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&蒋舒\n投降的路还真不好走。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,32,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[153,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":22,"offset":16174,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[716,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[139]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&李辅\n早知道就不淌这个浑水了…"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,716,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[139,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":23,"offset":16304,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":67,"name":"test_event6","args":[]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":22,"name":"info","args":["姜维被成都的乱军所杀。"]},{"op":73,"name":"ui_49","args":[]},{"op":14,"name":"ui_0e","args":[]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[1,1]},{"op":13,"name":"next_scene","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":2,"offset":16384,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":16386,"title":"驹�岢B竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹�岢B竚"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":8,"name":"set_result","args":[0]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[